OL,3,AWhy some have no choice but to pay
OL,4,Acostly oil prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the temperature drops, some of us
OL,7,Fwill start putting the heating on but
OL,8,Ffor the one-and-a-half million people
OL,9,Facross the UK that are not on the mains
OL,10,Fgas network - and who are relying
OL,11,Finstead on heating oil - that decision
OL,12,Fmay give them pause.
OL,14,FThe vast majority of those people live
OL,15,Fin rural locations.
OL,17,FThe heating oil market is unregulated,
OL,18,Funlike gas and electricity, so any
OL,19,Fchanges in the global price quickly
OL,20,Fgets passed on to customers.
