OL,3,AWhy some have no choice but to pay
OL,4,Acostly oil prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FTensions in the Middle East and the
OL,7,Fongoing war in Ukraine are two issues
OL,8,Fcurrently both affecting supply which
OL,9,Fis causing prices to rise.
